          "evidence_refs": [
            "EC-EF-039",
            "EC-EF-043"
          ],
          "step_number": 2
        },
        {
          "content": "DATUMS (DRT = 4) shall not be purged automatically.",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EC-EF-007"
          ],
          "step_number": 3
        },
        {
          "content": "If, for any reason such as operator error, the simulation status of a track is to be changed, the track shall be dropped using the J7.0 (ACT=0) message, and a new track shall be reported. Exit: the J7.0 drop is transmitted and the new track is reported.",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EC-EF-017"
          ],
          "step_number": 4
        },
        {
          "content": "As an exception to the simulation-status drop rule, a change from live to simulated shall be accepted without the J7.0 (ACT = 0) drop when the track is being received from an FJU.",
